Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's her. She wanted the full program.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We agreed she could use the whip, until I rang for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She hit like a lion tamer, so I had to ask her to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not easy when you're tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It took a while for her to stop; I lay there eyes shut,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,teeth clenched, totally groggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then suddenly she's pissing in my face,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.47,0:00:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and she was done before I could say a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have time to ring.
